    {
      "id": "OxdXxnhYswz4duLQwfmYp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -59.46066256385848,
      "y": 7484.927038916314,
      "width": 1598.0840379281292,
      "height": 222.2971843244742,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHf",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 757788896,
      "version": 165,
      "versionNonce": 981147872,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764781256386,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "User creates timer → Generate session ID → Store in Redis → Return shareable link\nOther users open link → Connect to WebSocket room → Subscribe to session updates\nAny user action → Send to server → Server updates Redis → Broadcast to all clients\nTimer ticks → Server-side interval → Update Redis every second → Broadcast current time\nSession ends → Auto-cleanup after expiry period",
      "fontSize": 35.56754949191587,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "User creates timer → Generate session ID → Store in Redis → Return shareable link\nOther users open link → Connect to WebSocket room → Subscribe to session updates\nAny user action → Send to server → Server updates Redis → Broadcast to all clients\nTimer ticks → Server-side interval → Update Redis every second → Broadcast current time\nSession ends → Auto-cleanup after expiry period",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "WoyxwI0Ah_mZALsFB08X1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 648.1552082511078,
      "y": 7771.526455201573,
      "width": 796.6698608398438,
      "height": 935.4401517459626,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "pJ-9pZB-sIN9aexKkEczA"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bIkd",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1586017568,
      "version": 489,
      "versionNonce": 1532759264,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764783085112,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "## Server-Hosted Architecture (WebSocket)\nServer Components\nTimer Manager Service:\n\nRuns timer intervals server-side\nMaintains authoritative state in Redis\nHandles all client actions\nBroadcasts to all connected clients in room\n\nWebSocket Server:\n\nManages client connections\nRoutes messages to appropriate session rooms\nHandles reconnection logic\nRate limiting per session\n\nSession Storage (Redis):\n\nStores active session state\nTTL-based cleanup (24 hours)\nPub/sub for multi-instance scaling\n\nClient Behavior\nConnection:\n\nClient opens WebSocket to server\nSends JOIN message with session ID\nServer subscribes them to session room\nClient receives full state sync\nListens for broadcasts\n\nInteraction:\n\nClient sends action → Server validates → Updates state → Broadcasts to all\nServer ticks timer every second → Broadcasts current time\nIf client disconnects → Server keeps running → Client can reconnect",
      "fontSize": 20.787558927688057,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "## Server-Hosted Architecture (WebSocket)\nServer Components\nTimer Manager Service:\n\nRuns timer intervals server-side\nMaintains authoritative state in Redis\nHandles all client actions\nBroadcasts to all connected clients in room\n\nWebSocket Server:\n\nManages client connections\nRoutes messages to appropriate session rooms\nHandles reconnection logic\nRate limiting per session\n\nSession Storage (Redis):\n\nStores active session state\nTTL-based cleanup (24 hours)\nPub/sub for multi-instance scaling\n\nClient Behavior\nConnection:\n\nClient opens WebSocket to server\nSends JOIN message with session ID\nServer subscribes them to session room\nClient receives full state sync\nListens for broadcasts\n\nInteraction:\n\nClient sends action → Server validates → Updates state → Broadcasts to all\nServer ticks timer every second → Broadcasts current time\nIf client disconnects → Server keeps running → Client can reconnect",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
