      "text": "create-session - Generate a new timer room\njoin-session - Add user to existing room\ntimer-action (play/pause/reset) - Broadcast\nstate changes\nsync-request - Send current state to newly\njoined user\ndisconnect - Handle cleanup when users leave",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "ojjP1ybsJXb1SLgLD9_vq",
      "originalText": "create-session - Generate a new timer room\njoin-session - Add user to existing room\ntimer-action (play/pause/reset) - Broadcast state changes\nsync-request - Send current state to newly joined user\ndisconnect - Handle cleanup when users leave",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
