      "updated": 1764856250005,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1.WebSocket Connection Management - Accept and maintain persistent connections from\nmultiple clients\n  2.Session/Room Management - Create and manage individual timer rooms that users can join\nvia links\n3.State Synchronization - Ensure all clients in a room see the same timer state\n4. Command Processing - Handle play/pause/reset commands from any connected client and\nbroadcast to others",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "zFMqEksUTsnCDl9ecH4Z_",
      "originalText": "1.WebSocket Connection Management - Accept and maintain persistent connections from multiple clients\n  2.Session/Room Management - Create and manage individual timer rooms that users can join via links\n3.State Synchronization - Ensure all clients in a room see the same timer state\n4. Command Processing - Handle play/pause/reset commands from any connected client and broadcast to others",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
